1
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:47,120
This is the third victim,

2
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,933
whom was gruesomely murdered
in the middle of the city.

3
00:03:50,153 --> 00:03:53,000
The murderer used ruthless
and bizarre murder methods.

4
00:03:53,321 --> 00:03:56,100
Forensic officers are currently working hard.

5
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:58,511
But still, no evidence has been collected

6
00:03:58,584 --> 00:03:59,673
since the first corpse,

7
00:04:00,041 --> 00:04:03,560
except the knitted yarn that the murderer left behind
to mock the authorities.

8
00:04:04,114 --> 00:04:07,693
The media therefore called this serial killer
the Yarns Murderer.

9
00:04:08,104 --> 00:04:13,805
We the common people can only pray
and hope that the police can arrest the culprit soon.

10
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:16,299
reported by Saowani Eadlao.

11
00:04:17,085 --> 00:04:18,587
Thank you, Ms. Saowani.

12
00:04:19,100 --> 00:04:22,780
This is the most shocking murder
in more than twenty years

13
00:04:23,102 --> 00:04:27,846
since we have had the Killer Genes Act.

14
00:04:28,264 --> 00:04:33,346
So today, let's go back
and get to know this law again.

15
00:04:33,721 --> 00:04:35,600
Going back almost thirty years ago,

16
00:04:35,801 --> 00:04:40,497
Thailand faced an economic crisis in 1997

17
00:04:41,053 --> 00:04:44,504
and also had a very high crime rate.

18
00:04:45,266 --> 00:04:47,116
And it's getting more serious day by day.

19
00:04:47,492 --> 00:04:50,380
As the government spokesperson,

20
00:04:51,248 --> 00:04:55,033
I'm declaring the law to control
those with killer genes.

21
00:04:55,846 --> 00:05:00,393
All Thai citizens must undergo a killer gene test

22
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:04,431
to enter the next process of population registration.

23
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:09,200
The government at that time collaborated
with the Crime Science Department.

24
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:15,040
Enacted laws to test for killer genes in all Thai citizens
to control their behaviors.

25
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:27,300
A large number of people came out
to strongly oppose and attack the government

26
00:05:27,815 --> 00:05:30,191
because it is considered a violation of freedom.

27
00:05:31,067 --> 00:05:33,652
The public opinion was divided into two sides.

28
00:05:33,986 --> 00:05:36,744
The argument almost led to a riot in the city.

29
00:05:37,509 --> 00:05:42,747
But then finally the law was revised
until it had fewer regulations.

30
00:05:43,113 --> 00:05:47,280
Until it was announced and enforced in 2000,

31
00:05:47,853 --> 00:05:51,179
under the leadership of Dr. Chonlathorn Traikanon

32
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:53,200
Genetics Specialist,

33
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:56,194
the Director-General of the Crime
Science Department at that time.

34
00:06:00,128 --> 00:06:04,827
To all Thai people, please rest assured

35
00:06:05,575 --> 00:06:09,273
that the law protects people with this killer gene.

36
00:06:10,027 --> 00:06:12,177
No one's freedom will be violated.

37
00:06:12,980 --> 00:06:14,803
All Thai people

38
00:06:15,944 --> 00:06:18,928
still have equal rights and freedoms as before.

39
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,772
And I promise you

40
00:06:22,010 --> 00:06:23,714
that in five years from now,

41
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:28,984
if the crime growth rate does not decrease significantly

42
00:06:30,434 --> 00:06:31,300
This is me.

43
00:06:32,226 --> 00:06:34,546
I will be the one to propose the repeal of this law.

44
00:06:35,391 --> 00:06:40,215
The law governing the behavior of those with killer genes has been in place for over twenty years.

45
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:45,234
The violent crime rate has decreased significantly.

46
00:06:45,714 --> 00:06:49,982
And the crimes that occurred were ordinary, non-violent cases.

47
00:06:51,346 --> 00:06:53,370
We have lived peacefully for a long time.

48
00:06:53,746 --> 00:06:57,328
Until three consecutive murders occurred.

49
00:06:57,652 --> 00:07:02,747
After the announcement of his candidacy for Prime Minister
Dr. Chonlathorn's recently

50
00:07:03,787 --> 00:07:10,048
That could mean that Dr. Chonlathorn's killer gene theory is about to be disproved.

51
00:07:17,805 --> 00:07:22,278
This news is starting to affect
your popularity more and more.

52
00:07:23,370 --> 00:07:25,180
If the murderer is still not caught

53
00:07:25,453 --> 00:07:30,243
I think the results of this election
may not be as you expected.

54
00:07:33,770 --> 00:07:34,640
Take it easy.

55
00:07:37,126 --> 00:07:38,400
Leave it to the police.

56
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,046
But looking at the murder's methods,

57
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,184
the suspect definitely has killer genes.

58
00:07:49,415 --> 00:07:51,179
Wait for the police to catch them.

59
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,307
After the genes are detected from the suspect,

60
00:07:55,972 --> 00:07:57,961
I assure you that the backlash will definitely happen.

61
00:08:00,883 --> 00:08:05,370
And how can you trust that this is not a set-up to discredit you?

62
00:08:05,892 --> 00:08:07,335
Find a scapegoat.

63
00:08:07,965 --> 00:08:09,339
When no genes are detected,

64
00:08:09,843 --> 00:08:11,026
you will be ruined.

65
00:08:12,048 --> 00:08:16,573
And now our spy reports that a special unit will be set up to handle this case specifically.

66
00:08:17,596 --> 00:08:22,681
I think you should send our people to look into the transparency of this case.

67
00:08:41,109 --> 00:08:43,680
From the shocking murder cases of the past month.

68
00:08:44,493 --> 00:08:46,194
Evidence from the forensic science division

69
00:08:46,984 --> 00:08:48,594
and forensic evidence,

70
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:54,838
it is agreed that all three cases are connected.

71
00:08:55,419 --> 00:08:59,001
And it's highly possible that it's the same murderer.

72
00:09:05,293 --> 00:09:08,820
The Royal Thai Police therefore
declares this case a special case.

73
00:09:09,245 --> 00:09:11,186
It is classified as a serial murder case

74
00:09:13,711 --> 00:09:16,010
and a special investigation unit was set up to take responsibility,

75
00:09:17,088 --> 00:09:18,678
under the care of

76
00:09:21,488 --> 00:09:23,940
Police Lieutenant Colonel Pilanthorn Traikanon

77
00:09:39,721 --> 00:09:40,733
May I have your permission?

78
00:09:41,283 --> 00:09:42,306
"Traikanon"

79
00:09:42,594 --> 00:09:44,323
What is your relationship with Dr. Chonlathorn?

80
00:09:48,900 --> 00:09:50,139
I am his son.

81
00:09:53,930 --> 00:09:56,520
This case is related to your father's popularity base.

82
00:09:56,646 --> 00:10:00,208
Are you sure that you can close the case transparently without scapegoating?

83
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,370
That's right.

84
00:10:05,283 --> 00:10:06,434
Absolutely guaranteed.

85
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,224
With police honor,

86
00:10:10,476 --> 00:10:11,648
My work...

87
00:10:12,518 --> 00:10:13,773
must be guiltless and just.

88
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:16,942
I promise you.

89
00:10:18,048 --> 00:10:22,066
That no politician will be able to interfere
with my investigation process.

90
00:10:22,977 --> 00:10:25,415
But the politician you're talking about is your father.

91
00:10:30,890 --> 00:10:32,709
So how are you going to answer the people?

92
00:10:35,067 --> 00:10:40,295
Mr. Saran, can you tell me why Dr. Chonlathorn's son has to take charge of this case?

93
00:10:40,671 --> 00:10:43,419
That's right. How can you expect the public to trust you?

94
00:10:43,547 --> 00:10:46,723
That's right. How can this not be a political intervention?

95
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,760
Can you catch the culprit?

96
00:11:17,777 --> 00:11:19,005
People throughout the building are talking about it.

97
00:11:20,031 --> 00:11:22,681
That your father loves popularity more than his own son.

98
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,749
That's why they dare to let you do this extremely difficult case.

99
00:11:27,944 --> 00:11:28,723
But that's it.

100
00:11:29,645 --> 00:11:32,445
Even if we catch the culprit,
and that damn genes cannot be detected.

101
00:11:32,869 --> 00:11:33,958
He could make it happen.

102
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,650
No one can change the test results, sir.

103
00:11:37,933 --> 00:11:39,280
Except the police ourselves.

104
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,551
And on the other hand

105
00:11:41,714 --> 00:11:44,911
Doesn't Dr. Chonlathorn have the right to be suspicious
that there is someone behind it

106
00:11:45,116 --> 00:11:48,817
who do not wish him well and try to make up stories to refute that theory.

107
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:55,880
The position of Prime Minister is a game that many people are trying to do everything to achieve, sir.

108
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:00,493
Both father and son are equally arrogant.

109
00:12:01,833 --> 00:12:04,360
Then you should hurry up and drag
the culprit back as soon as possible.

110
00:12:07,565 --> 00:12:08,417
Here.

111
00:12:09,777 --> 00:12:11,113
Your team list.

112
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,224
And if you want to ask for anything more, you can submit a report.

113
00:12:16,438 --> 00:12:17,363
But I have one request.

114
00:12:23,252 --> 00:12:24,424
Close this case as soon as possible.

115
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,040
Yes, sir.

116
00:12:29,746 --> 00:12:32,525
The deceased was Mr. Anon Insam, aged 23 years.

117
00:12:32,876 --> 00:12:35,593
The autopsy began at 3:54 p.m.

118
00:12:49,227 --> 00:12:50,768
What kind of forensic photographer are you?

119
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:53,377
Just seeing this makes you feel shocked.

120
00:12:53,980 --> 00:12:55,241
An.

121
00:12:55,798 --> 00:12:57,165
Since I started working

122
00:12:57,714 --> 00:13:00,379
I've never seen a corpse so brutal before.

123
00:13:01,659 --> 00:13:03,419
What were you thinking when you jumped into this job?

124
00:13:03,580 --> 00:13:05,980
Hey, I studied this field.

125
00:13:06,351 --> 00:13:08,097
I also want to see something new.

126
00:13:08,504 --> 00:13:11,248
It's not a day that I have to sit here and perform
simple autopsies over and over again.

127
00:13:11,864 --> 00:13:13,714
It's not challenging at all.

128
00:13:14,626 --> 00:13:16,170
This is what I've been dreaming about.

129
00:13:23,947 --> 00:13:25,120
You are dreaming of

130
00:13:26,337 --> 00:13:27,000
the bodies or

131
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:28,834
working with someone particularly?

132
00:13:29,690 --> 00:13:30,386
Mark.

133
00:13:30,629 --> 00:13:32,013
Shut up.

134
00:13:33,012 --> 00:13:33,843
Do your job.

135
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,252
An, look at this.

136
00:13:40,379 --> 00:13:41,286
What is this wound?

137
00:13:42,156 --> 00:13:43,180
It seems like he was bitten.

138
00:13:46,490 --> 00:13:47,182
Ants.

139
00:13:47,801 --> 00:13:50,706
The forensic unit said they found a large ant nest when the body was found.

140
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:34,960
Shit.

141
00:16:04,135 --> 00:16:04,841
Mark

142
00:16:05,648 --> 00:16:06,459
Help me turn the body over.

143
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,200
Take a photo here

144
00:16:49,297 --> 00:16:52,086
Have the blood test results of the deceased, Mr. Anont Insam, come out yet?

145
00:16:55,213 --> 00:16:56,960
Yes, please hurry.

146
00:17:01,760 --> 00:17:02,380
Lan

147
00:17:06,062 --> 00:17:08,132
We never thought that An would become a forensic scientist for our team.

148
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:12,313
What a coincidence, we suddenly ended up working together.

149
00:17:19,787 --> 00:17:22,956
Hello, I'm Anya. I'm a forensic doctor.

150
00:17:23,474 --> 00:17:26,104
This is Mark, a forensic photographer.

151
00:17:27,053 --> 00:17:31,335
This is Sergeant Nawin, the chief of forensics in our team.

152
00:17:31,909 --> 00:17:33,742
Here, Sergeant Moo is my assistant.

153
00:17:34,518 --> 00:17:35,980
-Hello.
-Please have a seat.

154
00:17:40,925 --> 00:17:42,267
What are the autopsy results?

155
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:04,000
This is a photo from the autopsy.

156
00:18:04,201 --> 00:18:07,523
The victim's wrists and ankles were bound with duct tape.

157
00:18:08,132 --> 00:18:09,655
We can see it from the marks on the skin.

158
00:18:10,525 --> 00:18:12,292
So, in conclusion, how did the victim die?

159
00:18:18,132 --> 00:18:18,883
Ants.

160
00:18:21,923 --> 00:18:23,106
What do ants have to do with this?

161
00:18:24,090 --> 00:18:24,806
Er...

162
00:18:25,286 --> 00:18:28,580
When we found the body, we found a lot of ants eating the body, Sergeant.

163
00:18:29,092 --> 00:18:32,380
But we assume that the ants
probably came after the victim died.

164
00:18:33,286 --> 00:18:34,059
No, it's not.

165
00:18:35,867 --> 00:18:37,133
At that time, the victim was still alive.

166
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:40,379
What does that mean?

167
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,280
The murderer injected Bupivacaine into the victim.

168
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:37,241
It is a type of local anesthesia used for injection during spinal block to relieve pain.

169
00:19:38,003 --> 00:19:42,695
Now, the person who has received the spinal anesthesia will feel numbness from the lower to the middle of the body.

170
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:46,361
It depends on the injection spot and the amount used.

171
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,904
In summary,

172
00:21:57,516 --> 00:22:00,852
the victim did not die from being slashed in the abdomen.

173
00:22:01,965 --> 00:22:06,834
But the victim died from being bitten by red ants that bit his internal organs.

174
00:22:07,801 --> 00:22:08,744
What did you say?

175
00:22:11,895 --> 00:22:15,415
We found dirt in our lungs, which was the same dirt we found in the ant nest.

176
00:22:15,906 --> 00:22:18,921
This means that the victim was still
breathing when the red ants bit him.

177
00:22:21,269 --> 00:22:22,170
Slit the abdomen

178
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:25,227
and use anesthesia to relieve pain

179
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:29,800
but leaving the victim to death by being bitten by ants, destroying your liver, kidneys, and intestines?

180
00:22:31,533 --> 00:22:32,685
Clearly a psychopath.

181
00:22:33,523 --> 00:22:35,980
To kill the victim in such a bizarre way.

182
00:22:37,180 --> 00:22:38,040
Lan

183
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:42,233
From this corpse that I autopsied
and the first two corpse reports,

184
00:22:42,960 --> 00:22:46,229
the culprit may be in the medical field.

185
00:22:47,400 --> 00:22:51,248
They seemed to have a great deal of knowledge and expertise about medicine and medical equipment.

186
00:22:53,290 --> 00:22:57,464
So does that mean that if we have a box of pills or a syringe with a number code on it,

187
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:59,763
We can narrow down the scope of the culprit?

188
00:23:02,351 --> 00:23:03,040
Lieutenant?

189
00:23:04,681 --> 00:23:07,353
We have no evidence of what the doctor said.

190
00:23:07,979 --> 00:23:08,991
All three cases?

191
00:23:13,989 --> 00:23:14,914
Then let's do this, Sergeant.

192
00:23:14,970 --> 00:23:19,429
Go to every hospital near the scene of the incident and ask what medicine is missing.

193
00:23:19,777 --> 00:23:21,600
- Then report to me immediately.
- Noted.

194
00:23:22,107 --> 00:23:23,766
- Lieutenant, the yarn.
- Yes.

195
00:23:24,111 --> 00:23:24,852
Here it is.

196
00:23:25,502 --> 00:23:27,822
We checked for DNA and found nothing.

197
00:23:32,521 --> 00:23:34,622
Then we have to start investigating these yarns.

198
00:24:12,511 --> 00:24:13,878
Inspector?

199
00:24:14,507 --> 00:24:16,702
We've been looking for it for a week now.

200
00:24:17,390 --> 00:24:21,513
But no store has the kind of yarn
that the murderer used.

201
00:24:22,834 --> 00:24:23,881
But...

202
00:24:24,406 --> 00:24:27,412
This shop looks quite big, so maybe there are some.

203
00:24:27,954 --> 00:24:29,902
Sathu, I hope there is.

204
00:24:31,180 --> 00:24:32,765
Is there anything I can help you with?

205
00:24:34,055 --> 00:24:34,716
Hello.

206
00:24:35,300 --> 00:24:39,944
Does your shop have the yarn like this?

207
00:24:40,302 --> 00:24:41,290
Let me see.

208
00:24:46,956 --> 00:24:51,064
Our shop doesn't have this type. We only have regular yarn and Venus yarn.

209
00:24:52,163 --> 00:24:53,980
You've been looking for so long.

210
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:57,231
-Sergeant.
-I think it looks pretty.

211
00:24:57,641 --> 00:25:00,139
Did your girlfriend knit? Her knitting is beautiful.

212
00:25:00,191 --> 00:25:03,580
She used imported yarn.
It's expensive and hard to find.

213
00:25:04,048 --> 00:25:05,808
- Imported yarn?
- Yes.

214
00:25:07,304 --> 00:25:10,570
In Thailand, do you happen to know
which store we can buy it?

215
00:25:10,883 --> 00:25:11,944
Um

216
00:25:12,806 --> 00:25:14,907
I can't think of any. It's unlikely.

217
00:25:17,760 --> 00:25:18,956
Not likely, okay.

218
00:25:19,645 --> 00:25:22,059
- Anyway, thank you very much.
- Pleasure.

219
00:25:23,186 --> 00:25:25,440
- Oh wait, wait, wait.
- Yes?

220
00:25:26,229 --> 00:25:27,339
There is one shop.

221
00:25:27,645 --> 00:25:28,681
There should be.

222
00:26:22,553 --> 00:26:24,514
This is the shop that the lady mentioned.

223
00:27:04,160 --> 00:27:04,920
Hello.

224
00:27:06,803 --> 00:27:08,476
Hello, are you the owner of the shop?

225
00:27:12,295 --> 00:27:14,507
- Hello.
- Hello.

226
00:27:15,686 --> 00:27:17,040
Is there anything I can help you with?

227
00:27:23,829 --> 00:27:25,133
I am the owner of the shop.

228
00:27:26,281 --> 00:27:29,947
If you want anything,
what kind of yarn do you want, just ask.

229
00:27:31,704 --> 00:27:32,200
Sure.

230
00:27:35,600 --> 00:27:36,925
Do you have this yarn?

231
00:27:43,116 --> 00:27:45,297
I am Police Lieutenant Colonel Pilanthorn Traikanon.

232
00:27:47,060 --> 00:27:48,462
I'm working on a case.

233
00:27:49,293 --> 00:27:52,780
I would like to ask the shop to
kindly cooperate with the police.

234
00:27:54,862 --> 00:27:55,720
Yes.

235
00:28:05,433 --> 00:28:07,739
From the picture, it's not very clear.

236
00:28:07,916 --> 00:28:10,907
I can't tell if it's the same type of yarn
that we have in our shop.

237
00:28:11,638 --> 00:28:15,580
When you knit it into pieces,
it's hard to separate each yarn.

238
00:28:16,573 --> 00:28:17,920
If it's still in lines,

239
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,975
we can tell what kind of yarn it is.

240
00:28:24,893 --> 00:28:26,723
And what if you just look at this picture?

241
00:28:27,478 --> 00:28:30,048
Does the shop have anything similar?

242
00:28:30,549 --> 00:28:32,674
There might be, but they're different colors.

243
00:28:33,266 --> 00:28:34,900
This kind of yarn is hard to find.

244
00:28:35,053 --> 00:28:36,587
You have to order from overseas.

245
00:28:37,092 --> 00:28:38,859
So we just have to take orders.

246
00:28:39,638 --> 00:28:41,335
Not sure if it's all sold out yet.

247
00:28:42,455 --> 00:28:45,627
Could you please check for me
to see if there are any left?

248
00:28:48,120 --> 00:28:50,570
Sure, I'll go check it out for you.

249
00:28:51,151 --> 00:28:52,869
I wonder if there are still some left.

250
00:29:02,563 --> 00:29:04,674
Nowadays, people prefer to order via the Internet.

251
00:29:04,720 --> 00:29:06,086
They are all from abroad.

252
00:29:06,410 --> 00:29:07,603
This kind of yarn

253
00:29:07,944 --> 00:29:10,573
now is rare and must be imported.

254
00:29:19,360 --> 00:29:23,408
And what are these knitted patterns here?

255
00:29:25,060 --> 00:29:26,650
This should be.

256
00:29:26,730 --> 00:29:28,194
Oh, Sky.

257
